WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.520
It's eleven at night. A customer messages your business on WhatsApp. But you're busy. The reply comes late... and that customer? Gone.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:16.440
Now imagine this! Your own WhatsApp AI assistant, one that never sleeps. Meet Replyleaf!

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:22.900
Getting started? So easy! Connect your WhatsApp Business number, complete onboarding, and you're set!

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:29.560
Then train it on your business. Upload a file, or paste some text, review it, and that's it. Publish!

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:35.060
Bring your own AI key. Paste it once, and your AI provider bills you directly.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:40.770
And now? Every customer question, answered on WhatsApp, in just seconds!

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:47.740
What if a customer wants a real person? No problem! The chat comes straight to you, with an alert.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:54.740
Need an appointment? The request comes from the chat. Confirm it in one click, and let the customer know right there.

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.890
Something went wrong? A ticket is created, and tracked all the way to resolved!

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:06.660
Every project enquiry? A lead! With the brief and notes, all in one place.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:13.210
And keep an eye on usage: your AI replies, tokens, and your WhatsApp free allowance.

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:19.050
And the moment a customer wants to talk about a project enquiry, you get an email alert, instantly!
